{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2022-07-01 07:02:00', 'title': "BROWN & BROWN, INC., COMPLETES THE ACQUISITION OF\xa0PATRICK QUINLAN INSURANCE BY O'LEARY INSURANCE LTD.", 'text': "DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., JULY 01, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED ACQUISITION OF QUINLAN INSURANCE BY O'LEARY INSURANCES LTD., PART OF BROWN & BROWN."}